            1579                     !> - Calculate the change in moist static energy, moisture mixing ratio, and horizontal winds per unit cloud base mass flux near the surface using equations B.18 and B.19 from Grell (1993) \cite grell_1993, for all layers below cloud top from equations B.
                                   <<< Loop-information Start >>>
